	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat770010b"},
		line=1257,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I awaken the next morning in Miyoshi's tatami room.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I reach to take the old cushion I was using as a pillow out from under my head...",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"But my fingers come into contact with a wholly different object.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“*Zzz...*”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wha─”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"As I turn my head, I suddenly find Mutsumi-san's face right above mine.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"She's dozing off peacefully with a gentle expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"It looks like at some point, she rested my head in her lap.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"If she managed all that without waking me, I must have completely let down my guard here at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"I feel the softness of her thighs on the back of my head as Mutsumi-san stirs slightly.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Nmm, nmh...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“So... sama...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"She seems to be talking in her sleep.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"I take another look at Mutsumi-san's sleeping face.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"For a brief moment, the elegance of her features steals my breath away.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Her cherry-blossom lips quiver with each of her breaths, sending her long, delicate eyelashes fluttering in turn.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Yet the graceful dignity of her features is contrasted by the childlike innocence of her unguarded sleeping expression.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"I realize for the first time in my life that two forms of beauty can coexist in such perfect harmony.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Her breath tickles the tip of my nose, sending my heart beating a little faster in spite of myself.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Nmh... Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You mustn't do that... not in a place like this...”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"That's some terrifying sleeptalk.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I'd better wake her up already.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“...Oh?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"She slowly blinks her eyes open, looking down at me with a drowsy expression.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, good morning, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You seem to have slept well.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I did happen to have a very comfortable pillow.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I do apologize. You were just simply too adorable as you slept.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Adorable?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Yes, very much so.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"She softly strokes my hair with a contented smile.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, this is the first time I have ever let anyone sleep in my lap.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I was concerned that I might wake you, but you continued to sleep most soundly.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I must have really let down my guard to be taken advantage of in my sleep.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I made my infiltration most surreptitiously.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You would do well to not underestimate me, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've never heard of the assailant falling asleep on the job, though.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Seeing you sleep so peacefully made me feel terribly drowsy as well.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“As ashamed as I am to admit it.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You were talking in your sleep. Were you having a nice dream?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Yes, very much so. A wonderful dream, where the Empire was at peace, and you and I were... Ehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san giggles to herself as she resumes stroking my hair.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"What in the world could she have been dreaming about?",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh my, it's almost time to begin preparing the ingredients. I should move along.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“About time I get up as well.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I try to raise myself up, but Mutsumi-san gently lays a hand on my chest.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“On second thought, wouldn't you care to stay like this for a while longer?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You would not be opposed to catching a little more sleep, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should get up already. I also have my training to get to.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“How uncharitable.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"As I hoist myself up, Mutsumi-san makes a show of puffing out her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That was the first time I've slept on someone's lap.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A pretty good experience, all things considered.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If you'd like another taste, please feel free to ask me again.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right, I hope you'll indulge me when the time comes.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I lower my head to Mutsumi-san before heading off to the washroom.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"When I return from washing my face, Mutsumi-san is already preparing her ingredients.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, would you be interested in practicing your cookery?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you think I can manage it?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Blades and kitchen knives are both implements for cutting, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ahaha, that's one way to put it.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I wash my hands and take up the knife Mutsumi-san hands me.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"It's her favorite chef's knife.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you really fine with me using this?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“By all means. Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"I hold the knife with the same grip I've seen her use countless times.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Try loosening your grip. Just relax and let your hand wrap naturally around it.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It is no different from wielding a blade.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“See, just like this.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san reaches her arms underneath mine as though moving to embrace me.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Her slender fingers overlap with my rough digits clutching the knife.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Even through our clothes, her womanly softness makes itself abundantly clear.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, aren't you a little close?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It's the best way to show you.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Out of the corner of my eye, I notice that her cheeks are faintly flushed.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"First letting me sleep in her lap, and now this. She's not acting like her usual self.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Is she seeing her younger brother in me?",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Or is what she feels a different emotion?",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I stop moving the knife, turning to glance at Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"She happens to be glancing at me as well.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"As soon as our eyes meet, she hastily returns her gaze to the knife in my hands.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I-It's dangerous to look away while you're holding a knife.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could say the same to you.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I-I'm used to it.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Our overlapping hands slowly grow warm.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, we need to cut these vegetables next.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? Ah, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"I lower my gaze back to my hands.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Could it be that Mutsumi-san really has romantic feelings for me?",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“They have my deepest sympathies, but I unfortunately have no interest in affairs of the heart.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“After all, a female warrior lives only for the blade.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"But even if she did, she would never allow herself to express those feelings.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"I think that's fine.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"We spend some time preparing a medley of summer ingredients like eggplant and ginger.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Compared to Mutsumi-san's meticulous knifework, all the vegetables I've cut are crude and misshapen.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've still got a long ways to go compared to you.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Everyone starts out like this.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Knowing you, Soujin-sama, you will improve very quickly.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san gently pats me on the back.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"It's as though she's praising a young child.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha, you're acting just like a mother.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, I am not nearly so old.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“A young lady as myself would be your sister at most.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I sure wouldn't mind having an elder sister like you.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You are most welcome to start calling me 'Onee-san' from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, I think I'll pass.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Smiling wryly, I quickly wash my hands.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I'm off to school now.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh, you're no fun at all.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san purses her lips in disappointment.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"At the same time, she looks somewhat relieved.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Perhaps she was intentionally acting cheerfully to dispel the otherwise somber atmosphere.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh, I almost forgot. Here you are, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san takes a bundle out from under the counter.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I prepared your lunch for you.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I made sure to include plenty of tofu, so I do hope you enjoy it.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really went and made me lunch?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Could it be that you thought I was joking?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san shows me a pouty expression.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course not. Thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"I take the lunchbox from Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Is it my imagination, or is it really rather heavy?",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I made sure to prepare extra, so if you have trouble finishing it, please do share it with everyone else.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sure it'll make everyone's day to taste your cooking.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Nothing would make me happier.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san smiles bashfully at me.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, right, Mutsumi-san.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm off at the shop today, so I'll come straight back after school.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please teach me more about cooking.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Of course. It would be my pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I'll be going now.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san sends me off with a smile as I leave Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Lunch break begins, and I arrive at the cafeteria with the usual suspects.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Everyone's eyes go wide as I unpack Mutsumi-san's lunchbox.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“S-Soujin-sama, did you make all this?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Come on, as if.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's all Mutsumi-san's handiwork.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She made extra for me to share with all of you.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The lacquered lunchbox is divided into nine neat compartments.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Salmon fried rice, rolled omelettes, ginger-glazed sweetfish─each compartment is more delicious-looking than the last.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"On top of that, the lunchbox is exquisitely garnished with seitan and carrots cut in the shape of flowers.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Before even considering the taste, it comes across as a fine work of art.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Not to mention, three of the nine compartments are filled to the brim with tofu dishes.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That sure is an awful lot of tofu...”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're imagining things.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It almost feels like a waste to eat.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Great, more for the rest of us.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wha─I'll still eat it, okay?!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"With Akari's exclamation as our cue, all of us begin reaching our chopsticks into the lunchbox.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"I start right away with the miso tofu.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"The delicate sweetness of the miso glaze spreads across my tongue as its savory aroma hits my nostrils.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"All of it is balanced out by the subtle umami of the tofu, making for a truly exquisite taste.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Everyone reacts with the same delighted expression upon taking the first bite of their dish of choice.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Damn is this good, but there's not really enough for all of us.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'll go get us some more stuff.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Shino turns an eye toward the buffet menu.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Mhm, the meat's out in full force today. Lady Priestess, charge!”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Onward!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"The two girls, full of appetite, begin raiding the buffet in high spirits.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Akari takes the opportunity to lean over for a private conversation.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you really think she'd go this far just because she sees her brother in you?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I really do think Mutsumi-san might be...”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if she is, she wouldn't say it.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then why don't you try to make it easier for her to say it?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Better to let sleeping dogs lie.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Unbidden, I think back to the sensation of Mutsumi-san's lap and the warmth of her hand on mine.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"As well as the expression she showed me when we inadvertently made eye contact.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"The passionate fervor in her eyes at that time was not the kind of expression you'd typically direct at a family member.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Still, why would Mutsumi-san have those kinds of feelings for me?",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"I suppose it's a waste of time thinking about that, though.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Only Mutsumi-san herself can answer that.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“They have my deepest sympathies, but I unfortunately have no interest in affairs of the heart.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“After all, a female warrior lives only for the blade.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What if you really fell in love with someone?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If that were to happen...”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I should hope that I might have the strength to take those feelings to the grave.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Is Mutsumi-san, true to her words, stifling the affection in her heart?",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"If so... that's simply too tragic.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Classes come to an end, and our group heads out from school.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Shino left ahead of us on account of her work with the Kurushima Group.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you're heading straight to Miyoshi, right?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I have the day off at the shop.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Suddenly, I spot a familiar face standing at the school gates.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"It's Mutsumi-san, no two ways about it.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"She's scanning the crowd as though searching for someone.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"A group of smooth-talking Republican boys approach her, but she politely turns them away.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh? Mutsumi-san?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like it.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Eventually, she notices us and greets us with a dainty wave.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"We turn to head straight towards her.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, what're you doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I was running some errands in the neighborhood.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I happened to realize school was about to let out, and so I thought it might be nice to walk home together.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Tell us in advance next time! I didn't even recognize you at first.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I'm terribly sorry, Hotori-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Truth be told, I was hoping to give Soujin-sama a little startle.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san shows us a coy smile.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes go wide at this unimaginable display of mischief from Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Did you partake of my lunch?”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, it was wonderful!”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It was so delicious I thought my cheeks might fall off...”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Kotone's jaw goes slack as she reminisces about the taste.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I am delighted that it was so well received.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It would be my pleasure to prepare another one anytime.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san flashes us a motherly smile.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Pl-Pl-Pl─!”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please allow me to call you my Onee-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Kotone leaps straight into Mutsumi-san's chest.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, it seems like I have found myself an adorable little sister.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san catches Kotone in her arms, gently stroking her head.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Care to join us, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I'll pass.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, we should get going soon.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Of course. If it pleases you, would you care to join me in collecting some ingredients?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure thing. I'll carry all the bags you could want.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"I wave goodbye to the others and head for the shopping district alongside Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Finished with our shopping, we amble along the twilit street back to Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Surely it's not just my imagination that our shoulders are awfully close to each other.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"As our eyes meet, Mutsumi-san tilts her head in puzzlement.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Did you perhaps want to do this?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Seemingly arriving at a conclusion, Mutsumi-san holds out her hand to me.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Umm... I thought perhaps you wanted us to hold hands.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not at all.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"I answer her plainly.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh, it seems I misunderstood. My apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“However, might I make such a request myself?”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san shows me the same elegant smile I've seen countless times.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"I can't detect any trace of grief or sorrow in her expression.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Despite her vow to stifle her feelings, it seems that she\ncan't help but crave a slight connection.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"I don't pretend to understand the workings of a woman's heart.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"But if it can bring her some small measure of comfort...",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"I proffer my hand in place of a reply.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san reservedly intertwines her delicate fingers with mine.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"The smoothness of her slender fingers completely belies her mastery over the blade.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“This is my first time holding hands with a gentleman.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It is a little more nerve-wracking than I anticipated.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san murmurs, the faintest of blushes crossing her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The lunch you made was truly delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Seeing everyone's smiles made it well worth it.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Did you enjoy the tofu?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, it was exquisite.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee. Why, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“...Did you have any other thoughts?”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Umm, for instance, remarks on anything other than the taste?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"For some reason, she's delving for my impressions.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The presentation was also truly beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hmm...”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Well, no matter.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I shall prepare many more tofu dishes in the future as well, so please look forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san clenches her fist, fired up with motivation.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've been wondering for a while now. Who was it that taught you how to cook?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“No one in particular. Even since before the war, I have always enjoyed cooking.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Before the war, huh?",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"This is just hearsay from Hotori, but apparently Mutsumi-san and I weren't particularly close back then, on account of us belonging to different dojos.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know this is a strange thing to ask, but did we ever talk before the war?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed, we certainly did.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I see you still have no recollection.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you wouldn't mind, could you tell me what we talked about back then?”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, it was nothing of consequence.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“My own recollections are not particularly clear either.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"With a subdued smile, Mutsumi-san tries to put an end to the conversation.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Even someone as imperceptive as I can tell she's glossing over some important details.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Come, we should make haste, else we won't make it in time for opening.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“There is still plenty of preparation work to be done, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san pulls me by the hand, and I follow along in silence.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Though our hands are still connected, I can't help but feel like the distance between us has grown wider.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
